{
 "id": "seg4",
 "title": "审计与上线",
 "pill": 4,
 "total": 111.14,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg4-00",
   "text": "测试做足了，才轮到外部审计。",
   "spoken": "测试做足了，才轮到外部审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 4.012
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-01",
   "text": "审计期间冻结代码，审计的对象，是某一个提交哈希。",
   "spoken": "审计期间冻结代码，审计的对象，是某一个提交哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-01.wav",
   "start": 4.46,
   "dur": 5.12,
   "speechStart": 4.46,
   "speechEnd": 9.335
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-02",
   "text": "把规格、威胁模型、已知风险和测试覆盖率，一起交给审计方。",
   "spoken": "把规格、威胁模型、已知风险和测试覆盖率，一起交给审计方。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-02.wav",
   "start": 9.8,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 9.892,
   "speechEnd": 15.426
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-03",
   "text": "关键协议，请两家以上审计，各有侧重。",
   "spoken": "关键协议，请两家以上审计，各有侧众。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-03.wav",
   "start": 15.86,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 15.86,
   "speechEnd": 19.208
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-04",
   "text": "也可以在 Code4rena、Sherlock、Cantina 这类平台办审计竞赛，覆盖面更广。",
   "spoken": "也可以在 Code4rena、Sherlock、Cantina 这类平台办审计竞赛，覆盖面更广。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-04.wav",
   "start": 19.68,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 19.777,
   "speechEnd": 26.076
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-05",
   "text": "修复本身也可能带来新漏洞，所以修完要复审。",
   "spoken": "修复本身也可能带来新漏洞，所以修完要复审。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-05.wav",
   "start": 26.54,
   "dur": 4.24,
   "speechStart": 26.631,
   "speechEnd": 30.549
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-06",
   "text": "编译器版本也要记下来，查它有没有已知 bug，2023 年的 Vyper 事故，就出在编译器上。",
   "spoken": "编译器版本也要记下来，查它有没有已知 bug，2023 年的 Vyper 事故，就出在编译器上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-06.wav",
   "start": 31.0,
   "dur": 7.6,
   "speechStart": 31.107,
   "speechEnd": 38.45
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-07",
   "text": "审计之后，审计范围内的代码，一个字都不能再改。",
   "spoken": "审计之后，审计范围内的代码，一个字都不能再改。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-07.wav",
   "start": 38.82,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 38.82,
   "speechEnd": 43.218
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-08",
   "text": "接着是部署。",
   "spoken": "接着是部署。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-08.wav",
   "start": 43.68,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 43.68,
   "speechEnd": 44.777
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-09",
   "text": "用脚本部署，不手动操作，脚本本身也要评审。",
   "spoken": "用脚本部署，不手动操作，脚本本身也要评审。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-09.wav",
   "start": 45.18,
   "dur": 3.92,
   "speechStart": 45.18,
   "speechEnd": 48.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-10",
   "text": "部署和初始化，放在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "spoken": "部署和初始化，放在同一笔交易里完成。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-10.wav",
   "start": 49.32,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 49.421,
   "speechEnd": 52.697
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-11",
   "text": "部署后在区块浏览器上验证源码，再跑一个验证脚本，把关键参数逐个读出来，和预期对比。",
   "spoken": "部署后在区块浏览器上验证源码，再跑一个验证脚本，把关键参数逐个读出来，和预期对比。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-11.wav",
   "start": 53.14,
   "dur": 8.48,
   "speechStart": 53.235,
   "speechEnd": 61.369
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-12",
   "text": "最后，把权限从部署账户移交给多签和时间锁，撤销部署账户的所有角色。",
   "spoken": "最后，把权限从部署账户移交给多签和时间锁，撤销部署账户的所有决色。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-12.wav",
   "start": 61.84,
   "dur": 7.04,
   "speechStart": 61.84,
   "speechEnd": 68.732
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-13",
   "text": "还有一件常被跳过的事，在目标链上测。",
   "spoken": "还有一件常被跳过的事，在目标链上测。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-13.wav",
   "start": 69.1,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 69.1,
   "speechEnd": 72.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-14",
   "text": "在以太坊上测过，不代表在目标链上能跑。",
   "spoken": "在以太坊上测过，不代表在目标链上能跑。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-14.wav",
   "start": 72.68,
   "dur": 3.68,
   "speechStart": 72.68,
   "speechEnd": 76.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-15",
   "text": "在 BNB Chain 上，BSC-USD 的精度是 18 位。",
   "spoken": "在 BNB Chain 上，BSC-USD 的精度是 18 位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-15.wav",
   "start": 76.58,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 76.58,
   "speechEnd": 81.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-16",
   "text": "出块间隔是 0.45 秒，相邻两个区块的秒级时间戳，可能一样。",
   "spoken": "出块间隔是 0.45 秒，相邻两个区块的秒级时间戳，可能一样。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-16.wav",
   "start": 81.52,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 81.52,
   "speechEnd": 86.906
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-17",
   "text": "在 TRON 上，要实测 USDT 转账的返回值，去 Nile 或 Shasta 测试网跑，不要只用本地 EVM。",
   "spoken": "在 TRON 上，要实测 USDT 转账的返回值，去 Nile 或 Shasta 测试网跑，不要只用本地 EVM。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-17.wav",
   "start": 87.34,
   "dur": 9.12,
   "speechStart": 87.433,
   "speechEnd": 96.274
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-18",
   "text": "在 Mantle 上，随交易附带的原生币是 MNT，ETH 只是一个 ERC-20 代币。",
   "spoken": "在 Mantle 上，随交易附带的原生币是 MNT，ETH 只是一个 ERC-20 代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-18.wav",
   "start": 96.68,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 96.68,
   "speechEnd": 103.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg4-19",
   "text": "部署前，在目标链的测试网或者主网分叉上，把完整测试跑一遍。",
   "spoken": "部署前，在目标链的测试网或者主网分叉上，把完整测试跑一遍。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep27/audio/lines/seg4-19.wav",
   "start": 104.1,
   "dur": 5.84,
   "speechStart": 104.195,
   "speechEnd": 109.756
  }
